      "text": "duty of Apostles to watch over Church, D&C 20:42. duty of teachers to watch over Church, D&C 20:53 (84:111). he who watches not for the Lord shall be cut off, D&C 45:44. they who have watched for iniquity shall be hewn down, D&C 45:50. bishop ordained to watch over Church, D&C 46:27. watch that ye may be ready, D&C 50:46. let elders watch over churches, D&C 52:39. watch, for adversary spreads his dominions, D&C 82:5. watch, for you know neither day nor hour of the Lord’s coming, D&C 133:11.",
